{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../channel-participants-search/", "title": "ChannelParticipantsSearch"}, "next": {"link": "../chat-admin-rights/", "title": "ChatAdminRights"}, "title": "Chat", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"chat\">\n<h1>Chat<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#chat\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.Chat\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Chat</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.Chat\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/chat/#pyrogram.raw.base.Chat\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Chat\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Chat</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">41CBF256</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">64-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>title</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>photo</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/chat-photo/